# 16. COMMUNITY API ACCESS

Authentication into this avatar application does NOT automatically imply the application should use MonoES community functionality.

Only request:

```text
community:read
```

if a feature needs authenticated MonoES GET endpoints.

Only request:

```text
community:write
```

if a feature genuinely needs POST/PATCH/DELETE actions against MonoES.

If both are needed, request both.

Do not assume:

```text
community:write
```

implies:

```text
community:read
```

---

# 17. OPTIONAL MONOES INTEGRATION LATER

Design authorization so additional MonoES functionality can be added later without changing login architecture.

Possible future integration:

```text
MonoESOAuthProvider
        │
        ├── Authentication
        │
        └── MonoES API access
```

Separate identity authentication from business API authorization.

